				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We support the pragmas {{gtPragma:ttStartUp}} and {{gtPragma:ttShutDown}} as a convenience, the process of registering Classes for startup and shutDown \"officially\" is more fiddly than it need be. Once the implementation of a class has settled down it may make more sense to use the official pattern.\n\nAn example of this is {{gtMethod:ImageStoreResolver class>>initialize}} which has its own priorities\n\nNow there is a question, do we have an need for instance level #startUp\nIt can be done, perhaps Vaults want to - re-read themselves...\n"
			}
		]
